{"parentUuid":"9ca03bc1-e477-464d-becb-46cca1b33775","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a6d508ceece21642a","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01HwwVZc8ESnm2zH2pBQPhk3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018JybfvMfnrkDUVfVqHDSUC","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"Hexaly LocalSolver 13 placement packing 2D rectangle benchmark 2025"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1406,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3355,"cache_read_input_tokens":21164,"output_tokens":508,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3355},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1406,"output_tokens":508,"cache_read_input_tokens":21164,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3355,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3355,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaoquLtZTqU6h4ZyJWDDS","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"cf104205-a2ef-4003-9d0e-995a7efc141b","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:31:49.476Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ea7fe282-d839-468c-a012-7e2e9da4d4b3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"8dfd7d49-883e-40c9-8948-d7864c6a5fee","agentId":"a6d508ceece21642a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AhXvUGgRh2iHtpHfWTtm2V","type":"tool_result","content":"# MiniZinc Challenge 2024 Medal Winners\n\nBased on the results page, here are the medalists across all tracks:\n\n## Fixed Category\n- **Gold:** OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- **Silver:** Choco-solver CP-SAT\n- **Bronze:** SICStus Prolog\n\n## Free Category\n- **Gold:** OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- **Silver:** PicatSAT\n- **Bronze:** iZplus\n\n## Parallel Category\n- **Gold:** OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- **Silver:** PicatSAT\n- **Bronze:** Choco-solver CP\n\n## Open Category\n- **Gold:** OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- **Silver:** PicatSAT\n- **Bronze:** Choco-solver CP\n\n## Local Search Category\n- **Gold:** OR-Tools CP-SAT LS\n- **Silver:** Yuck\n- **Bronze:** (Not listed on results page)\n\n## Key Observation\n\nOR-Tools CP-SAT dominated the competition, claiming gold across four of the five categories. The only track where a different solver won gold was Local Search, where OR-Tools CP-SAT LS (a variant configuration) took the top position. PicatSAT emerged as the primary challenger, securing silver medals in both Free and Parallel categories."}]},"uuid":"38685680-b2f6-4506-80ab-b968b9c49fde","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:31:49.598Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ea7fe282-d839-468c-a012-7e2e9da4d4b3","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"00b46e62-8d10-4333-bc7b-ee796827c076","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"8dfd7d49-883e-40c9-8948-d7864c6a5fee","agentId":"a6d508ceece21642a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015HfKfGvaZ8vhZNYNR9cWGs","type":"tool_result","content":"# MiniZinc Challenge 2025 Medal Winners\n\nBased on the results table provided, here are the medal winners by category:\n\n## Fixed Category\n- **Gold:** OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- **Silver:** Choco-solver CP-SAT\n- **Bronze:** SICStus Prolog / Pumpkin\n\n## Free Category\n- **Gold:** OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- **Silver:** PicatSAT\n- **Bronze:** Choco-solver CP-SAT\n\n## Parallel Category\n- **Gold:** OR-Tools CP-SAT\n- **Silver:** PicatSAT\n- **Bronze:** iZplus\n\n## Local Search Category\n- **Gold:** OR-Tools CP-SAT LS\n- **Silver:** Yuck\n- **Bronze:** Atlantis\n\n**Summary:** OR-Tools CP-SAT dominated the competition, winning gold in all four categories. The document notes that \"there is no OPEN medal this year as there were no portfolio solver entrants at the competition deadline.\" While other solvers like Choco-solver and PicatSAT secured silver and bronze medals, neither Chuffed nor other organizer-entered solvers earned podium finishes, as \"these entries are not eligible for prizes.\""}]},"uuid":"fa99a183-7073-4b32-a2d7-66e9f7f4bbdc","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:31:51.750Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"00b46e62-8d10-4333-bc7b-ee796827c076","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"cf104205-a2ef-4003-9d0e-995a7efc141b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"8dfd7d49-883e-40c9-8948-d7864c6a5fee","agentId":"a6d508ceece21642a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018JybfvMfnrkDUVfVqHDSUC","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Hexaly LocalSolver 13 placement packing 2D rectangle benchmark 2025\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"New release: LocalSolver 12.0\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/announcement/new-release-localsolver-12-0\"},{\"title\":\"Hexaly\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Optimization Benchmarks\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/benchmarks\"},{\"title\":\"Solvers for Scheduling and Routing Problems |\",\"url\":\"https://dmcommunity.org/2024/04/16/localsolver-is-now-hexaly/\"},{\"title\":\"Benchmarks\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/benchmarks?redirect=\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver 8.0 — Hexaly 13.0 documentation\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/last/changelog/localsolver80.html?redirect\"},{\"title\":\"Hexaly | LinkedIn\",\"url\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/hexaly\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver (LocalSolver 12.5 API)\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/12_5/java/localsolver/LocalSolver.html\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver (LocalSolver 8.0 API)\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/8_0/java/localsolver/LocalSolver.html\"},{\"title\":\"LocalSolver 7.0 — Hexaly 14.0 documentation\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/docs/last/changelog/localsolver70.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found relevant information about Hexaly and optimization benchmarks:\n\nLocalSolver has been renamed to Hexaly, which claims to be the world's fastest optimization solver for Routing, Scheduling, and Packing problems. The search results show information about various optimization benchmarks for the Hexaly platform.\n\nHowever, the search results do not contain specific information about \"Hexaly LocalSolver 13 placement packing 2D rectangle benchmark 2025.\" The results show information about LocalSolver 12.0 and other versions, as well as general benchmark categories that Hexaly offers, but don't provide the specific 2D rectangle placement/packing benchmark data you're looking for.\n\nThe benchmarks include a mix of research and industrial datasets related to problems like vehicle routing, scheduling, packing, and other problems related to supply chain and workforce management. If you need more specific details about the 2D rectangle placement packing benchmark, you may want to visit Hexaly's official benchmarks page directly at hexaly.com/benchmarks, which may have more detailed technical specifications than what appeared in these search results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"9e6d964e-8c0c-4801-a0d4-5f9d989bb478","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:31:54.516Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cf104205-a2ef-4003-9d0e-995a7efc141b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"9ca03bc1-e477-464d-becb-46cca1b33775","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"8dfd7d49-883e-40c9-8948-d7864c6a5fee","agentId":"a6d508ceece21642a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DNrAmkpFLVKeHExZKbDmxj","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CP Optimizer IBM 22.1 academic license placement scheduling benchmark\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Constraint program solvers - IBM CPLEX\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio/cplex-cp-optimizer\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) IBM ILOG CP optimizer for scheduling: 20+ years of scheduling with constraints at IBM/ILOG\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/323859275_IBM_ILOG_CP_optimizer_for_scheduling_20_years_of_scheduling_with_constraints_at_IBMILOG\"},{\"title\":\"Introduction to Scheduling Concepts in CP Optimizer\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/icos/22.1.1?topic=concepts-introduction-scheduling-in-cp-optimizer\"},{\"title\":\"IBM ILOG CPLEX Optimization and CP Optimizer License\",\"url\":\"https://decisionbrain.com/cplex/\"},{\"title\":\"IBM ILOG CPLEX Optimization Studio\",\"url\":\"https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio\"},{\"title\":\"IBM ILOG CP Optimizer for Detailed Scheduling Illustrated on Three Problems | SpringerLink\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-642-01929-6_12\"},{\"title\":\"Hexaly, CP Optimizer, OR-Tools, Gurobi, Cplex on very large-scale instances of the Job Shop Scheduling Problem (JSSP)\",\"url\":\"https://www.hexaly.com/benchmarks/hexaly-vs-cp-optimizer-vs-or-tools-on-the-job-shop-scheduling-problem-jssp\"},{\"title\":\"IBM ILOG CP optimizer for scheduling - ACM Digital Library\",\"url\":\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1007/s10601-018-9281-x\"},{\"title\":\"Planning/Scheduling with CP Optimizer\",\"url\":\"https://cp2019.a4cp.org/PDFs/P-Laborie.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - IBMDecisionOptimization/cpofzn: CP Optimizer back end for Minizinc · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/IBMDecisionOptimization/cpofzn\"}]\n\nI found search results related to IBM CP Optimizer and scheduling benchmarks. Here are the key findings:\n\n**CP Optimizer Overview:**\nIBM® ILOG® CP Optimizer is a necessary and important complement to the optimization specialist's toolbox for solving real-world operational planning and scheduling problems. For pure academic problems such as job-shop, open-shop and flow-shop, it finds solutions that are comparable to solutions found by state-of-the-art specialized algorithms.\n\n**Scheduling Benchmarks:**\nThe search results reference benchmark comparisons involving CP Optimizer. Recent benchmarks compare IBM ILOG CP Optimizer 12.10.0, Google OR-Tools CP-SAT 9.14, Gurobi 11.0.1, and IBM ILOG Cplex 22.1.0 on job shop scheduling problems. CP Optimizer's results after 6 hours show how it performs on scheduling benchmarks compared to other solvers.\n\n**Academic License Information:**\nIf you are an academic, you can access CPLEX Optimization Studio for free.\n\nHowever, the search results don't contain specific information about a placement scheduling benchmark for CP Optimizer version 22.1 with an academic license. For more detailed information about specific benchmark datasets or resources, you may want to consult IBM's official documentation or contact IBM's decision optimization support.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"05f466ec-5eb1-4dea-9e9e-469d15f5b4bd","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:31:54.548Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9ca03bc1-e477-464d-becb-46cca1b33775","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
